  - statementId: 2
    basicConversation:
    - id: 2
      conversation: What Ryuin delivered can be reported together with mine at the same time after finishing my mission. Apart from this, can you help me? This is a secret introduction, though, I can't do it by myself. I heard the enemy have biological weapons. Can you check whether they really exist and destroy them instead?
